; Stationery · To Do — its words in English. Original work, MIT licensed.
; Strings-Chinese.inc has the same keys. The counts are written [&Measure:0], the form that is read when
; the text is shown. Menu titles are Title Case and at most 30 characters.

[Variables]
; the header, the add row and the list's messages
ToDoTitle=To Do
ToDoLeft=[&MeasureOpen:0] left
ToDoMore=+[&MeasureMore:0] more
ToDoNewItem=New Item
ToDoListFull=List Full
ToDoEmpty0=
ToDoEmpty1=Nothing to do
ToDoEmpty2=All done
; the menu
ToDoMenuCompleted0=Completed Items: Hidden
ToDoMenuCompleted1=Completed Items: Shown
ToDoMenuClear=Clear Completed ([&MeasureDone:0])
ToDoMenuEditAsText=Edit Items as Text…
; tooltips; the card's is the widget's sentence
ToDoTipCheck0=Mark as Done
ToDoTipCheck1=Mark as Not Done
ToDoTipAdd=Add an item at the top of the list
ToDoTipFull=The list holds 12 open items. Check one off or delete one to add another.
ToDoTipMore0=[&MeasureMore:0] more not shown. Click or scroll to see them.
ToDoTipMore1=Back to the top of the list
ToDoTipCard=[&MeasureOpen:0] left, [&MeasureDone:0] done. The list stays on this Mac.
